{
  "_about": [
    "Prop catalog: which Meshy preview each prop is built from, and how big it is in the world.",
    "tools/props/build.py turns each 'source' (under assets/meshy/previews/) into assets/models/props/<key>.glb:",
    "scaled to height_m, pivot at the bottom center, front facing +z. 'stretch' scales x/y/z after that.",
    "A textured source (…/textured/model.glb) keeps its texture. Otherwise the game paints props with 'color' (sRGB 0-1), switching to 'top_color'",
    "above 'top_from' (fraction of the height) for roofs, canopies, hay loads and so on.",
    "'collide' makes a prop solid (world/collision.py): {\"box\": k} is its footprint x k, {\"circle\": r} a",
    "radius in m, both scaled with the prop; 'top' is how high it blocks the camera (trees: the trunk).",
    "No 'collide' = walk through (bushes, pebbles, and the fence gate, which stands open)."
  ],
